==English==
[[Image:Rød ræv (Vulpes vulpes).jpg|thumb|right|A red fox (''Vulpes vulpes'')]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|es}}

# A common [[species]] of [[fox]], ''[[Vulpes vulpes]]'' native to [[North America]], [[Asia]], [[Europe]] and North [[Africa]]; small, with [[red]]dish [[fur]], but larger than the [[arctic fox]].
# A [[flowering plant]], {{taxlink|Celosia argentea|species|noshow=1|ver=160928}}, having brightly coloured [[flower]]s of several shades.

